  "description": "<p>The <strong>Electric USB Lint Remover &amp; Fabric Shaver</strong> is your essential tool for effortlessly renewing and maintaining your textiles. Designed for convenience, this portable device efficiently removes lint, fuzz, and fabric pills from all types of clothing and household fabrics. Whether you want to freshen up sweaters, blankets, or upholstery, this handheld lint remover is perfect for keeping your textiles looking their best. Its USB rechargeable feature offers cordless operation, making it easy to use at home or on-the-go. The protective shaving head ensures safe removal without damaging delicate fabrics, providing a gentle yet effective garment care solution.</p><h2>Key features</h2><ul>\n<li>Efficiently removes lint, fuzz, and fabric pills from garments and textiles</li>\n<li>Rechargeable via USB for cordless, portable use</li>\n<li>Gentle on fabrics with a protective shaving surface</li>\n<li>Suitable for sweaters, woolen wear, blankets, curtains, and upholstery</li>\n<li>Compact ergonomic design for easy handling and travel</li>\n<li>Includes cleaning brush for easy maintenance</li>\n</ul><h2>Materials &amp; care</h2><p>Made from durable plastic with a high-quality shaving surface. Clean with the included brush and store in a dry place for long-lasting performance.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><dl>\n<dt>Q1: How often should I clean the device?</dt>\n<dd>A: Clean the lint container and blades regularly with the included brush to ensure optimal performance.</dd>\n<dt>Q2: Is it safe on all fabrics?</dt>\n<dd>A: Yes, the protective shaving head makes it safe for most fabrics, including delicate textiles.</dd>\n<dt>Q3: How long does the battery last on a full charge?</dt>\n<dd>A: The device offers several sessions of use per charge, depending on the fabric thickness.</dd>\n<dt>Q4: Can I use it on both clothes and upholstery?</dt>\n<dd>A: Absolutely, it is designed to be versatile for clothes, furniture, and more household textiles.</dd>\n<dt>Q5: 